subsection.p:
          The code below shows how to attach a Control to an STextfield. This control is 
          triggered when the user hits the enter key while this STextField object has focus: 

STextField p = new STextField(); 
p.setControlID(LoginController.VALIDATE_LOGIN_CONTROL_ID); 

          SButtons can be created by passing in a Control to the constructor. This causes the 
          Control String to be displayed on the SButton and causes the SButton to automatically 
          call issueControl(Control c) when clicked. 

SButton loginButton = new SButton(LoginController.VALIDATE_LOGIN_CONTROL_ID);
